        <mxCell id="leak" value="&lt;b&gt;Leakage controls applied at steps 9 to 12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:9px;text-align:left&#x27;&gt;[A15] StandardScaler moved inside the Pipeline so it refits on every CV fold&lt;br&gt;[A16] Feature-variant selection performed on training-period CV, not on the 2023-2025 test set&lt;br&gt;[A17] cv_frame restricted to the training period; Ridge alpha changed from 1.0 to 0.1&lt;br&gt;The held-out test set is used once only, at final evaluation.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;arcSize=8;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
